flowchart TB
    team[Team]
    role[Role]
    agent[Persistent agent]
    project[Project]
    assignment[Project assignment]
    case[Case]
    task[Task]
    deliverable[Deliverable]
    review[Review request]
    release[Release package]
    governance[Governance group]
    memory[Team memory]

    team -->|defines| role
    team -->|registers| agent
    team -->|owns| project
    agent --> assignment
    project --> assignment
    project --> case
    project --> task
    case <-->|validated link| task
    task --> deliverable
    deliverable --> review
    project --> release
    deliverable -->|accepted scope| release
    governance -->|member Team| team
    governance -->|managed by| agent
    team --> memory
    project --> memory
    agent -->|private scope| memory

    boundary[Governance observes and directs a member Team's manager;\nit does not own the Team's tasks or review decisions.]
    governance --- boundary
